sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Order as Order<br/>domain owner
  participant ODB as PostgreSQL<br/>Order DB
  participant Outbox as Outbox relay
  participant Kafka as Kafka<br/>order.confirmed
  participant Kitchen as Kitchen<br/>consumer
  participant Redis as Redis<br/>KDS projection
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>WebSocket hint
  participant KDS as KDS client

  Order->>ODB: Commit order PROCESSING<br/>and PENDING outbox row atomically
  Outbox->>ODB: Poll pending outbox rows
  Outbox->>Kafka: Publish order.confirmed
  Kafka-->>Kitchen: Consume event
  Kitchen->>Kitchen: Validate schema and contract
  Kitchen->>Redis: Create station tickets<br/>and queue projection
  Kitchen->>BFF: Publish kds.queue_changed hint
  BFF-->>KDS: WebSocket hint
  KDS->>BFF: Refetch latest KDS state

  Note over Order,KDS: Staff confirmation does not wait for KDS ticket creation.<br/>Kafka and WebSocket carry side effects after the Order commit.
